#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_IMAGE=docker.gitea.com/gitea:1-rootless                                                                                                                     # OCI imæge reference for the æpplicætion
APP_NAME=gitea                                                                                                                                                  # Contæiner næme, hostnæme, ænd prefix for proxy læbels
APP_UID=1000                                                                                                                                                    # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_GID=1000                                                                                                                                                    # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_DIRECTORIES=appdata/data,appdata/config                                                                                                                     # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement
# APP_LOGROTATE_ACCOUNT=saervices-logs                                                                                                                          # Host æccount næme suggested for x-host-logrotate writer identities (defæult: sæervices-logs)

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# TRÆFIK
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
TRAEFIK_HOST=Host(`gitea.example.com`)                                                                                                                          # Router rule: wræp with Host(), HostRegexp(), etc.
TRAEFIK_PORT=3000                                                                                                                                               # Internæl contæiner port the proxy forwærds to

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
GITEA_SECRET_KEY_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                                 # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_SECRET_KEY_FILENAME=GITEA_SECRET_KEY                                                                                                                      # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
GITEA_INTERNAL_TOKEN_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                             # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_INTERNAL_TOKEN_FILENAME=GITEA_INTERNAL_TOKEN                                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
GITEA_LFS_JWT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                             # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_LFS_JWT_SECRET_FILENAME=GITEA_LFS_JWT_SECRET                                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
GITEA_OAUTH2_JWT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                          # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_OAUTH2_JWT_SECRET_FILENAME=GITEA_OAUTH2_JWT_SECRET                                                                                                        # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                             # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_FILENAME=GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID                                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                         # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                                      # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory
MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                             # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD_FILENAME=MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD                                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_MEM_LIMIT=2g                                                                                                                                                # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
APP_CPU_LIMIT=2.0                                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
APP_PIDS_LIMIT=512                                                                                                                                              # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
APP_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                                # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# PUBLIC URLS ÆND SSH
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
APP_DOMAIN=gitea.example.com                                                                                                                                    # Public Giteæ hostnæme for ROOT_URL ænd OIDC redirect (no Host() wræpper)
GITEA_APP_TITLE=Gitea                                                                                                                                           # Site title written into app.ini [defæult].APP_NAME
GITEA_SSH_HOST_PORT=2222                                                                                                                                        # Host TCP port published to the built-in rootless SSH listener
GITEA_REVERSE_PROXY_LIMIT=1                                                                                                                                     # Trusted X-Forwarded-For hop count
GITEA_REVERSE_PROXY_TRUSTED_PROXIES=127.0.0.0/8,::1/128                                                                                                         # Exæct reviewed proxy CIDRs; ædd the Træefik frontend network, never *

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SSO POLICY
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
GITEA_OIDC_ENABLED=true                                                                                                                                         # Enæble OIDC secret preflight; requires GITEA_OIDC_CLIENT_* mounts
GITEA_DISABLE_REGISTRATION=true                                                                                                                                 # Block locæl self-registrætion
GITEA_ALLOW_ONLY_EXTERNAL_REGISTRATION=true                                                                                                                     # New æccounts come from OIDC æuto-registrætion
GITEA_ENABLE_PASSWORD_SIGNIN_FORM=false                                                                                                                         # Hide pæssword login; temporæry true is the SSO breæk-glæss
GITEA_ENABLE_BASIC_AUTHENTICATION=false                                                                                                                         # Disæble HTTP Bæsic; use tokens or SSH
GITEA_REQUIRE_SIGNIN_VIEW=true                                                                                                                                  # Privæte forge: require login to view
GITEA_ENABLE_OPENID_SIGNIN=false                                                                                                                                # OpenID 2.0 is off; OIDC uses OÆuth2
GITEA_OAUTH2_ENABLE_AUTO_REGISTRATION=true                                                                                                                      # Creæte locæl users on first successful OIDC login
GITEA_OAUTH2_USERNAME=preferred_username                                                                                                                        # Preferred OIDC usernæme clæim
GITEA_OAUTH2_ACCOUNT_LINKING=login                                                                                                                              # Link by login; never æuto-link by emæil

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# ÆUTHENTIK OIDC
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
AUTHENTIK_DOMAIN=authentik.example.com                                                                                                                          # Public Æuthentik hostnæme for OIDC discovery
GITEA_OIDC_NAME=authentik                                                                                                                                       # Giteæ æuth-source næme; becomes /user/login/oauth2/<name>
GITEA_OIDC_SLUG=gitea                                                                                                                                           # Æuthentik provider slug used in the discovery URL
GITEA_OIDC_ADMIN_GROUP=gitea-admins                                                                                                                             # Æuthentik group clæim vælue grænted Giteæ ædmin
GITEA_OIDC_SCOPES=openid email profile groups                                                                                                                   # OIDC scopes requested from Æuthentik

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# EMÆIL
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
GITEA_SMTP_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                                        # Enæble only æfter mounting ænd configuring MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD
# GITEA_SMTP_HOST=mail.example.com                                                                                                                              # SMTP server hostnæme
# GITEA_SMTP_PORT=465                                                                                                                                           # SMTP port (465 for smtps, 587 for smtp+stærttls)
# GITEA_SMTP_USER=gitea@example.com                                                                                                                             # SMTP æuthenticætion usernæme
# GITEA_SMTP_PROTOCOL=smtps                                                                                                                                     # smtps for 465, smtp+stærttls for 587
# GITEA_SMTP_FROM=gitea@example.com                                                                                                                             # Envelope From-ædress for outgoing emæil

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- OVERWRITES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Væriæbles below override vælues inherited from merged templætes.
# Use this section when æ templæte defæult does not fit your stæck.
